 "da0b651a-fcfb-511d-b9be-bc8a5694c2fd" :question/problem "Find the slope of $y=f(x)$ at $x=\\sqrt{3}$ if $f(x)=16\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-\\operatorname{sec}⁡x+\\frac{1}{x}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we calculate the derivative using the sum rule:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(16\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-\\operatorname{sec}⁡x+\\frac{1}{x}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(16\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-\\operatorname{sec}⁡x+{x}^{-1}) \\\\  & =16(-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)-\\operatorname{sec}⁡x\\operatorname{tan}⁡x-\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}} \\\\  & =-16\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\operatorname{sec}⁡x\\operatorname{tan}⁡x-\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we substitute $x=\\sqrt{3}$ in the derivative and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(\\sqrt{3}) & =-16\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\sqrt{3})-\\operatorname{sec}⁡(\\sqrt{3})\\operatorname{tan}⁡(\\sqrt{3})-\\frac{1}{(\\sqrt{3})^{2}} \\\\  & =-16\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\sqrt{3})-\\operatorname{sec}⁡(\\sqrt{3})\\operatorname{tan}⁡(\\sqrt{3})-\\frac{1}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["26b07204-20ad-5356-8e17-f3dabda037db"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "9f9c0dfe-55ae-53c0-9db7-e14b3bd6a2c0" :answer/id #uuid "9f9c0dfe-55ae-53c0-9db7-e14b3bd6a2c0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\sqrt{3})-\\operatorname{csc}⁡(\\sqrt{3})\\operatorname{cot}⁡(\\sqrt{3})-\\frac{1}{3}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "53178bc7-2dc1-53f1-a6a1-d11f22cc0728" :answer/id #uuid "53178bc7-2dc1-53f1-a6a1-d11f22cc0728" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-12\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\sqrt{3})-\\operatorname{sec}⁡(\\sqrt{3})\\operatorname{tan}⁡(\\sqrt{3})-\\frac{1}{3}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "adb4bd5d-b0da-59ca-bd21-1ba0eda6617c" :answer/id #uuid "adb4bd5d-b0da-59ca-bd21-1ba0eda6617c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-12\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\sqrt{3}